{c: Verse 1}
[D]Abhi na jaao [A]chhod kar,        ke dil abhi [D]bhara nahin
Abhi na jaao [A]chod kar,        ke [E]dil [A]abhi [D]bhara nahin
[D]Abhi abhi to aayi hoo,        [A]abhi abhi to... [D]
[D]Abhi abhi to aayi ho,        [A]bahar banke [D]chhayi ho
[D]Hawa zara ma [A]hak to le,        [D]nazar zara bahek to le
[G]Ye shaam dhal to le zara,        [G]Ye shaam dhal to le zara
[G]Ye dil samhal to le zara,        Main [D]thodi [A]der
[D]jee too lun,        [A]nashe ke ghuunt [D]pi to lun
[A]Nash ke ghunt [D]pi to lun,        [A]abhi to kuch [D]kaha nahin
[A]Abhi to kuchh [D]suna nahin,        [D]Abhi na jaao [A]chod kar
ke [E]dil [A]abhi [D]bhara nahin,        [A]Sitaren jhil mila uthe
[A]Sitaren jhil mila uthe,        [A]Charag jagmaga uthe
[A]Bas ab na mujhko tokna,        [A]Bas ab na mujhko tokna
[A]Na barhke raah rokna,        [D]Agar main ruk gayi abhi
[A]to jaa na paun [D]gi kabhi,        Ye [A]hi kahoge [D]tum sada ke
[A]dil abhi [D]nahin bhara,        [D]Jo khatm ho ki [A]si jaga ye aisa
sil [D]sila nahin,        [D]Abhi nahin abhi [A]nahin
